	"notice": "Original BeatStep, not BeatStep Pro. Select CNTRL for assignable controller messages or SEQ for sequencing. Configure pads, encoders and channels with MIDI Control Center. There is no dedicated MIDI input socket. Physical controls and keys remain unbound because presets, modes and octave settings determine messages. Diagrams are selected-control schematics, not dimensioned panel drawings. Port names are recorded only when documented; otherwise detection uses an unambiguous complete model name or manual selection.",
